# SPA API clients

- API base: `/rts/api/v1` (see `app/src/app/lib/api.ts`)
- All responses: `{ ok, data, error }` — use shared `apiGet` / `apiPost` helpers
- Mutating requests: send `X-CSRF-Token` from auth `me` response
- Backend action renames: update the TS client **and** regenerate `_System_Core/generated/140_Frontend_API_Clients.md`
- Route guards: mirror backend roles (`RequireAuth`, normalized CSR roles)

Cross-reference backend actions in `_System_Core/generated/100_API_Index.md` before changing query params or action names.
